  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "「機動戦士ガンダム SEED C.E.73 －STARGAZER－」より“スターゲイザーガンダム”がついにキット化！",
      "en": "“Stargazer Gundam” from “Mobile Suit Gundam SEED C.E.73 -STARGAZER-” is finally available as a kit!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "特徴的な背中の輪は、翼のような分割展開や円形のまま下部に移動することが可能。",
      "en": "The characteristic ring on the back can be split open like wings or moved to the bottom while remaining circular."
    },
    {
      "ja": "劇中に見せる光の輪をクリアパーツで再現、ジョイントを介し劇中同様重ねて装着可能。全身の黒い溝は、特殊シールを貼ることで発光するイメージを再現。",
      "en": "The ring of light shown in the movie is reproduced with clear parts, and can be stacked on top of each other via joints as in the movie. The black grooves all over the body are recreated with a special seal to give them the appearance of emitting light."
    },
    {
      "ja": "ふくらはぎ部スラスターのハッチは開閉可能。",
      "en": "The calf thruster hatch can be opened and closed."
    },
    {
      "ja": "ビームライフルと専用のディスプレイスタンドが付属",
      "en": "Comes with a beam rifle and dedicated display stand."
    },
    {
      "ja": "○初回出荷限定で「機動戦士ガンダム SEED C.E.73 －STARGAZER－」のダイジェスト映像無料視聴チケット封入。",
      "en": "○Limited to the first shipment, a free viewing ticket for the digest video of \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED C.E.73 -STARGAZER-\" is included."
    }
  ],
